      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "## 7. Appendix"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Health endpoints\n",
        "\n",
        "| Endpoint | Purpose | Auth |\n",
        "|----------|---------|------|\n",
        "| `GET /health/live` | Liveness probe | Public |\n",
        "| `GET /health/ready` | Readiness probe (pings DB) | Public |\n",
        "| `GET /health/version` | Build version, commit, date | Public |"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Supported column types\n",
        "\n",
        "| User type | Canonical | DB type | Python type |\n",
        "|-----------|-----------|---------|-------------|\n",
        "| `str`, `string`, `text` | `str` | `TEXT` | `str` |\n",
        "| `int`, `integer` | `int` | `INTEGER` | `int` |\n",
        "| `float`, `number`, `double` | `float` | `DOUBLE PRECISION` | `float` |\n",
        "| `bool`, `boolean` | `bool` | `BOOLEAN` | `bool` |\n",
        "| `uuid`, `uuid4` | `uuid` | `UUID` | `UUID` |\n",
        "| `datetime`, `timestamp`, `timestamptz` | `datetime` | `TIMESTAMPTZ` | `IsoDateTime` |\n",
        "| `dict`, `json`, `jsonb` | `dict` | `JSONB` | `dict` |\n",
        "| `list` | `list` | `JSONB` | `list` |\n",
        "\n",
        "Any type can be wrapped with `optional[...]` to allow null values (e.g. `optional[float]`)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Useful commands"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "print(\"# View server logs\")\n",
